### Step 5: Compute the distance

The distance from $ \mathbf{u} $ to the span is the norm of the projection error:

$$
\text{Distance} = \|\mathbf{u} - \mathbf{v}\|
$$

$$
\mathbf{u} - \mathbf{v} = \begin{bmatrix} 3 \\ 5 \\ 1 \\ -1 \end{bmatrix} - \begin{bmatrix} \frac{7}{6} \\ 2 \\ \frac{1}{6} \\ \frac{1}{6} \end{bmatrix}
= \begin{bmatrix} \frac{11}{6} \\ 3 \\ \frac{5}{6} \\ -\frac{7}{6} \end{bmatrix}
$$

$$
\|\mathbf{u} - \mathbf{v}\| = \sqrt{\left(\frac{11}{6}\right)^2 + 3^2 + \left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^2 + \left(-\frac{7}{6}\right)^2}
$$

Compute each term:

- $ \left(\frac{11}{6}\right)^2 = \frac{121}{36} $
- $ 3^2 = 9 = \frac{324}{36} $
- $ \left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^2 = \frac{25}{36} $
- $ \left(-\frac{7}{6}\right)^2 = \frac{49}{36} $

Add:

$$
\frac{121 + 324 + 25 + 49}{36} = \frac{519}{36}
$$

$$
\text{Distance} = \sqrt{\frac{519}{36}} = \frac{\sqrt{519}}{6}
$$

